      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CuI</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math>",
